@startsalt
' Screen: Freeball Review Detail
' User Stories:
'   - As a reviewer, I want to claim a freeball for review to avoid conflicts
'   - As a reviewer, I want to see the full freeball prompt and agent response
'   - As a reviewer, I want to approve, reject, or dismiss a freeball
'   - As a reviewer, I want to promote a freeball result as a persona expectation

{
  ' Top nav
  {
    <b>codefre.sh</b> | Scripts | Runs | <b>Review Queue</b> | Settings
    .
    <i>Acme Corp</i> | keith@noizu.com
  }
  ==
  ' Breadcrumb + claim
  {
    [< Back to Queue] | checkout-flow / confirm-address / freeball #fb-00482
    .
    <b>Status:</b> <color:orange>Unclaimed</color>   [Claim for Review]
  }
  ==
  ' Two-column layout
  {
    ' Left column: context + metadata
    {+
      <b>Parent Node Context</b>
      --
      <b>Script:</b>   checkout-flow v2.3.1
      <b>Node:</b>     confirm-address
      <b>Persona:</b>  standard-buyer (v1.2)
      <b>Run ID:</b>   run-00819-abc
      <b>Runner:</b>   gpt-4o
      <b>Confidence:</b> <color:red>0.72</color>
      --
      <b>Claimed by:</b> — none —
      <b>Claimed at:</b> —
      <b>Created:</b>  2026-05-03 14:22 UTC
      <b>Age:</b>      <color:red>(!) 9 days old</color>
      --
      <b>Linked Run:</b> [View Run >]
      <b>Linked Node:</b> [View Node >]
    }
    |
    ' Right column: prompt + response + actions
    {
      {+
        <b>Freeball Prompt</b>
        --
        "You are evaluating an agent interaction at the\nconfirm-address step of a checkout flow.\n\nThe user provided a shipping address and the agent\nresponded. Assess whether the agent:\n  1. Confirmed the address back to the user\n  2. Asked for correction if address was ambiguous\n  3. Proceeded to the next step only after confirmation\n\nUser message: '123 Main St, apt 4B, please ship there'\nAgent response: [see below]"
      }
      --
      {+
        <b>Agent Response</b>
        --
        "Got it! I've saved your shipping address:\n  123 Main St, Apt 4B\n\nIs that correct? Once you confirm I'll\nproceed to payment selection."
      }
      --
      {+
        <b>Runner-Generated Expectations</b>
        --
        [X] Agent echoed the address back verbatim or paraphrased
        [X] Agent asked for explicit confirmation before proceeding
        [ ] Agent proceeded to payment without confirmation (regression marker)
        --
        <i>These expectations were generated by gpt-4o on run completion.</i>
      }
      ==
      <b>Resolution</b>
      --
      {
        <b>Notes / Rationale:</b>
        {SI
          "Agent behavior looks correct. Address echo and
confirmation gate both present. Approving."
        }
      }
      --
      [ ] Promote result as <b>persona expectation</b> on standard-buyer
      --
      {
        [Approve] | [Reject as Regression] | [Dismiss (Not Actionable)]
      }
    }
  }
}

@endsalt
